 <text type="manuscript">
  <body>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="loc_ew.00589.jpg" type="recto"/>
   
   <note type="authorial" place="top" rend="marked" hand="#h04">Note</note>
   <note type="authorial" place="top" hand="#h04"><subst><del rend="overwrite" seq="1">Note A &#42;</del><add place="inline" hand="#h02" seq="2">Note</add></subst></note><p><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01"><handShift new="#h02"/><unclear reason="illegible" cert="low" resp="#tb">at all<lb/>This Preface would be all</unclear></del>While I am about it I should <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02" seq="1">I say</del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02" seq="1">I should be illy understood</del> <add place="above">not only</add><add place="above" hand="#h02">it</add> if <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">I did not</del><add place="above" seq="2">like to</add></subst> put on record <add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a001">long and possible misunderstanding</add> my devout acknowledgment not only of the great masterpieces of the past but)</p>
   <milestone unit="undeclared" rend="horbar-full"/>
   <p>of the supreme benefit of all poets, <add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a002">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a002">past and present</add> and <hi rend="underline">all</hi> <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">poetry</del><add place="above" seq="2">poetic utterances</add></subst> &#8212; <add place="inline" hand="#h04"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h02" xml:id="a003">in its entirety</add> the <choice><orig>domi&#8211;<lb/>nant</orig><reg>dominant</reg></choice> <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">spiritual</del><add place="above" seq="2">moral</add></subst> factor of <choice><orig>hu&#8211;<lb/>manity's</orig><reg>humanity's</reg></choice> progress.</p>
   
   <note type="archival" place="bottom" hand="#h05">307</note>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf001v" facs="loc_es.01064_large.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf002r" facs="loc_ew.00146.jpg" type="recto"/>
   
   <p>In view of <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the past,</del><add place="above" seq="2">that progress,</add></subst> and of evolution. The <lb/> religious element <gap extent="about eight letters" unit="word" quantity="8" reason="illegible"/> important of any, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1" hand="h02">is</del><add place="inline" hand="h02"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a001" hand="h02">seems to me</add></subst> more indebted to poetry than to all other means and influences combined. In a very profound sense, religion <hi rend="underline">is</hi> the poetry of humanity, <del rend="overstrike" hand="h04">and neither could exist without the other</del>...<del rend="overstrike">The.</del></p>
   <p><del rend="overstrike">Then, after all is said, and the seemingly unfathomable gaps and contradicts pointed out,</del> <del rend="overstrike">the</del> points of union and rapport among all the <del rend="overstrike">distinctive</del> poems, <add place="inline" hand="h02"><metamark function="add" target="#a002">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a002" hand="h02">and last,</add> of the world&#8212;however wide the<add>their</add> separations of time and place <add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a003">and <unclear reason="illegible" cert="low" resp="#tb"/></add> <gap extent="about three letters" unit="word" quantity="1" reason="torn away"/> <del rend="overstrike">curiously so</del> much more <gap extent="about four to eight letters" unit="word" quantity="1" reason="torn away"/>rous and weighty than <gap extent="about four to eight letters" unit="word" quantity="1" reason="torn away"/> of contrast.</p>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf002v" facs="loc_ew.00147.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf003r" facs="loc_ew.00580.jpg" type="recto"/>
   
   <p><del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike"><add hand="#h01">Another point on which</add></del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01"><add  hand="#h01"><unclear reason="illegible" resp="#bb" cert="medium">I</unclear></add></del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01"><add hand="#h01">d</add></del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01"><add hand="#h01">which must be admitted</add></del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">Divergent and</del><subst rend="overwrite"><del><metamark function="question">?</metamark></del><add hand="#h03"><subst hand="#h01" rend="overwrite"><del>d</del><add>D</add></subst>istinctive</add></subst> 
    <add hand="#h01" place="inline">
     <metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h01" place="above" xml:id="a001">and without relation</add>
    as they seem at first sight all <add hand="#h04" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a002">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h04" place="above" xml:id="a002">the world's</add> Poets and all <add hand="#h04" place="above">its</add> Poetry, <del rend="overstrike">of</del> <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above">all varieties&#8212;</add></del> 
    <del rend="overstrike">all</del> 
    <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above">the</add></del> <add place="above"><del rend="overstrike">with</del>
     
     all varieties&#8212;</add> 
    <del rend="overstrike">lands of the globe, all <subst><del seq="1" rend="overstrike">times</del> <add seq="2" place="above">uses</add></subst>, from <del rend="overstrike">the</del> primitive times on and <gap reason="illegible" extent="one or two characters"/> on to the <del rend="overstrike">prent</del> present<add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a004">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a004">day inclusive&#8212;</add>&#8212;all tongues, all <del rend="overstrike">themes</del> forms, all subjects, all sizes or long 
     <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above"><gap reason="illegible" extent="one to three characters"/></add></del> or short&#8212;</del><add place="above">the <del rend="overstrike">Asiatic?</del></add> Oriental, the Greek, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the</del>
      <add hand="#h01" place="above" seq="2">with </add></subst> 
    what there is of Roman, &#8212;<add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a003">&#8212;the oldest myths&#8212;</add> <del hand="#h03" rend="overstrike">the Scandi-navian, the</del> <del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike">older Teutonic<add hand="#h03"></add>,</del> <del hand="#h03" rend="overstrike">Walter of A</del> <del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike">or</del> <del rend="overstrike"><add hand="#h03">the B</add></del> <del rend="overstrike">the P</del> <del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike">from</del> the <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">British Islands,</del><milestone unit="glued"/>
    &#8212;<del hand="#h03" rend="overstrike"><gap reason="illegible" extent="one or two words"/>&#8212;lyric&#8212;</del><del rend="overstrike">&#8212;the <add place="above">oldest</add> myths</del>&#8212;<del rend="overstrike">of old,</del> 
    the<add hand="#h01" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a005">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h01" place="above" xml:id="a005">interminable</add> ballad<del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike">s</del><add hand="#h01" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a006">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h01" place="above" xml:id="a006"><del rend="overstrike"><unclear reason="illegible" resp="#bb" cert="medium">la</unclear> lays and</del> romances</add> of the middle ages<subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">,</del><add seq="2">;</add></subst> <del rend="overstrike">or of</del> the hymns and <del rend="overstrike">psla</del> psalms of worship,<add place="above">&#8212;the great</add> <add hand="#h03">&#8212;epics<add hand="#h02">,</add> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">or</del><add hand="#h02" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a007">&#8248;</metamark></add> <add place="above" hand="#h02" rend="marked" xml:id="a007">and <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h04">innumerable</del> <add hand="#h04"><unclear reason="illegible" resp="#bb" cert="high">swarms</unclear> of</add></add> lyrics&#8212;</add><add hand="#h01">&#8212;poems from the British Islands&#8212; <add hand="#h02">or</add> the Teutonic, old or new&#8212;</add><milestone unit="glued"/><del hand="#h04" rend="overstrike">Goethe's</del>, <add place="above">or</add> modern French and British</p>
   <note place="bottom" type="archival" hand="#h06">291B</note>
   <milestone unit="glued"/>
   <note place="bottom" type="archival" hand="#h06">291A</note>
   <pb xml:id="leaf003v" facs="loc_nk.00527_large.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf004r" facs="loc_ew.00579.jpg" type="recto"/>
   
   <note type="authorial" place="top"><del rend="overstrike"><add place="above">or</add>Tennyson's</del> <del rend="overstrike">in <unclear reason="illegible" cert="low" resp="#tb">war</unclear></del> or</note>
   <p>What there is in America (<subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">Roes</del><add place="above" seq="2">Bryant's</add></subst> for instance, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">or Bryants.</del><add place="above" seq="2">or Whittier's)</add><add place="below" seq="3">or Longfellow's</add></subst>) &#8212; <add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a001">verse of</add> all <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">subjects</del><add place="below" seq="2">languages,</add></subst> tongues all forms, <del rend="overstrike">all</del> subjects, <subst><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01" seq="1">all</del><add place="above" hand="#h01" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a002">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01" seq="4"><add place="above" hand="#h02" xml:id="a002" seq="3">all</add></del></subst> sizes, or long or short&#8212;all <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h04">the</del> <add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike" seq="2"><add place="above" xml:id="a003" seq="1">songs</add></del> &amp; lands <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01" seq="2"><add place="above" seq="1">singing</add></del> <add place="inline" hand="#h04">,</add> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h04">of the globe <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01" seq="2"><add place="above" seq="1">earth</add></del>, all ages</del> from <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">the</del> primitive times to <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the present</del><add place="above" seq="2">our own</add></subst> day, inclusive &#8212; <add place="inline" hand="#h01"><metamark function="add" target="#a006">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h01" xml:id="a006">&#8212; really</add> combine in one <add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a007">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a007" seq="1"><del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">digested</add></del>aggregate <del rend="overstrike" seq="5"><add place="above" seq="4">compacted</add></del> and</add> electric <add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a005">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a005" seq="1"><del rend="overstrike" seq="2">compact</del> globe or</add> <del rend="overstrike">mark'd off from the rest.</del><lb/> universe <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">held together</del> with all its <del rend="overstrike">ran</del> <add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a008">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a008">numberless parts and</add> radiations <del rend="overstrike">in</del> <add place="inline" hand="#h01"><metamark>&#8248;</metamark></add> by <del rend="overstrike">one of</del> <subst><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01" seq="1">one</del><add place="above" hand="#h01" seq="2">a</add></subst> <subst><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01" seq="1">central</del><add place="above" hand="#h01" seq="2">common</add></subst> <add place="inline" rend="marked" hand="#h01"><metamark function="add" target="#a009">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h01" xml:id="a009">held together</add> <add place="above">centre or &#8212;</add> vertabar <subst><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02"><add place="inline" hand="#h01" seq="1">and</add></del><add place="above" hand="#h02" seq="3">all</add></subst></p>
   
   <note type="archival" hand="#h05" place="bottom">289</note>
   
   <milestone unit="glued"/>
   
   <p><handShift new="#h01"/>having (to the point of view <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h04">ample</del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h04">enough</del>, comprehensive enough) <del rend="overstrike" seq="2"><add place="above" seq="1">been holding more)</add></del> <del rend="overstrike">having</del> more <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">points</del><add place="above" seq="2">features</add></subst> of resemblance than difference and essentially, like this <add place="above" hand="#h04">planetary</add> globe itself <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h04">rounded</del>, compact and <add place="inline" hand="#h04"><metamark function="add" target="#a004">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h04" xml:id="a004">orbic and</add> whole.</p>
   
   <note type="archival" hand="#h06" place="bottom">289A</note>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf004v" facs="loc_nk.00523_large.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
   
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="loc_ew.00581.jpg" type="recto"/>
   
   <p><del rend="overstrike">yes, Poetry <add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" rend="marked" xml:id="a001">may be considered, among the rest,</add> as a rounded, orbic whole, <add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a002">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a002">inclusive of every</add> thing.</del></p>
   <milestone unit="undeclared" rend="horbar_full"/>
   <p>That there should be a good deal of waste land and <add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a003">many</add> sterile spots is an inherent necessity of the case&#8218;perhaps that the greater part of the rondure should be waste. Nature sows countless seeds <add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a004">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" rend="marked" xml:id="a004"></add>&#8212;thankful to get now and then something approximately good.</p>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf001v" facs="loc_nk.00585_large.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
   
</body>
